    "module_designation": null,
    "description": "Scanner/scale (models 939404 and 939406), Class III, mains operated, self-indicating, weight only, single or dual interval, non-automatic weighing instrument. Designed for direct sales to the public and to be flush-mounted in a fixed position in a checkout surface; may be fitted with a level indicator. Devices: initial zero setting device, semi-automatic zero setting device, zero tracking device, automatic zero setting device, zero indicator, gravity compensation. Interfaces: POS terminal (RJ10), remote display (RJ4), scale host (RJ10), auxiliary port (RJ10), EAS port (RJ45), power (Molex 3 pin), USB, image port. Legally relevant parameters (scale configuration and calibration) stored in EEPROM; access to calibration mode only by switch behind a sealing cap. Components that may not be dismantled or adjusted by the user (EEPROM, calibration switch, load cell) secured by a tamper-evident solution bearing a securing mark."
